    <item>
      <title>Legacy mining mercury still pollutes Nevada rivers, raising concerns across Mountain West</title>
      <link>https://www.kunr.org/local-stories/2026-02-18/legacy-mining-mercury-pollutes-nevada-rivers</link>
      <description>More than a century after the Mountain West’s silver and gold rushes, mercury used to process those metals is still moving through a northern Nevada river system and showing up in local wildlife.</description>
