    <item>
      <title>Eight confirmed dead in Lake Tahoe area avalanche, one missing</title>
      <link>https://www.kunr.org/live-updates/lake-tahoe-avalanche</link>
      <description>As of Feb. 18, 2026 at noon, authorities say eight backcountry skiers are confirmed dead after an avalanche near Castle Peak, north of Interstate 80 near Donner Summit.</description>
